# Contrats de conception — serveur non implémenté
@baseUrl = http://localhost:8080/api/v1
@token = JETON_A_REMPLACER
@id = 00000000-0000-4000-8000-000000000001

### Lire son contrat
GET {{baseUrl}}/contracts/{{id}}
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

### Créer un jalon
POST {{baseUrl}}/contracts/{{id}}/milestones
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "title": "Exemple de conception du profil Dabber Khdma",
  "amount": 1200,
  "currency": "TND"
}

### Soumettre les métadonnées du livrable
POST {{baseUrl}}/milestones/{{id}}/submit
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "objectKey": "Exemple de conception du profil Dabber Khdma",
  "revision": 1
}

### Approuver un livrable
POST {{baseUrl}}/milestones/{{id}}/approve
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

### Demander une révision
POST {{baseUrl}}/milestones/{{id}}/request-revision
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "reason": "Exemple de conception du profil Dabber Khdma"
}

### Ouvrir un litige
POST {{baseUrl}}/contracts/{{id}}/disputes
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "reason": "Exemple de conception du profil Dabber Khdma"
}

### Démarrer un jalon planifié
POST {{baseUrl}}/milestones/{{id}}/start
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

